    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy present New to Market an attractive residential holding extending to approximately 20.16acres(8.16 hectares), offered for sale in three lots to provide flexibility for a range of purchasers. Lot 1 comprises a 4-bedroom residence on approximately 0.5 acres, requiring refurbishment and offering excellent potential to create a modern family home. Subject to satisfying the relevant scheme criteria, eligible to qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, with the potential for additional funding under the Derelict Top-Up grant where applicable. This presents purchasers with an excellent opportunity to significantly offset renovation costs . Lot 2 comprises approximately 19.56 acres of generally good quality agricultural land suitable for grazing, silage production and a variety of agricultural enterprises, together with a selection of traditional farm outbuildings. Lot 3 offers the entire holding, comprising the residence, lands and outbuildings extending to approximately 20 acres, presenting an excellent opportunity to acquire a compact residential farm with significant potential for renovation, farming and lifestyle living. Enquiries and viewings now invited. Lot 1 Guide Price: 115,000 euro. Lot 2 Guide Price: 130,000 euro. Lot 3 Guide Price: 245,000 euro.\n \n\nOutside\nMature residential site extending to approximately 0.5 acres Traditional farmyard with a selection of agricultural outbuildings Extensive agricultural lands extending to approximately 19.56 acresLands laid out in well-defined divisions with road frontage Suitable for grazing, silage and a range of farming enterprises Excellent countryside views"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Residential holding extending to approximately 20.16acres (8.16 hectares)\nOffered for sale in three separate lots or as one entire\nFour-bedroom residence requiring complete refurbishment\nEligible purchasers may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to approval). \nhttps://www.gov.ie/en/department-of-housing-local-government-and-heritage/services/vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/\nExcellent opportunity to modernise and create a superb family home\nApproximately 19.56 acres of good quality agricultural land\nTraditional farm buildings with further development potential (subject to planning permission where required)\nIdeal for farming, equestrian, hobby farming or residential buyers seeking land\nAttractive rural location with significant potential for owner occupiers and investors alike\nResidence consists of 4 Bedrooms (1 ensuite), central living room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Utility.\nApprox. 20.16 acres (8.16 hectares)\nTraditional farm outbuildings\n \n Electricty currently disconnected\nWater on Site\nSeptic Tank on Site"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 119653400"
      },
